  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ezekieli okworokererigwa aya agochia koba ase Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye Mwanyabaanto, imokia ritabori, oribeke bosio bwao, erio orimang’ere omogwekano bw’omochie o Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyogitere orwaki rw’okoyoboera ase chinsemo chionsi, na oyoetananie neburi boigo, naende oyobekere ebitwori bi’abarwani esegi, na otenenie ebikorero bi’ogotagorera ase chinsemo chionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oimokie esani y’ekioma, oyetenenie buna orwaki ase egati yao na omochie oyio; oyorigererie, oyoboere na ogenderere koyoboera. Ayio nabe ekemanyererio ase Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Erio aye oraarere orobega rwao rw’okobee, obe kobogoretie obobe bw’Abaisraeli igoro yao. Koreng’ana namatuko ayio orabe koraire igo, naboigo orabogorie obobe bwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nagochikeire amatuko amagana atato, na emerongo kianda (390); amatuko ayio nigo anga buna emiaka y’egesusuro ki’obobe bwabo, eyio nero engaki orabe kobogoretie obobe bw’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero orabe gwakoorire korara engaki eyio, naende oraarere orobega rwao rw’okorio, na obe kobogoretie obobe bw’Abayuda. Nagochiikeire amatuko emerongo ene, rituko erimo ndibe buna omwaka oyomo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bwasiorie eanga korwa ase okoboko kwao, origererie Yerusalemu oyio oboeire, erio obaane mamincha y’oro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ningosibe ne chingori, erinde tonyara koonchoka gochia ensemo ende yonsi goika obe gwakoorire amatuko ao ay’okoyoboera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oimokie engano, na esairi, ne ching’ende, ne chinchorogo, na amaemba, na engano ende, erio obeke ebinto ebio ase ekebekerero ekemo, obiochoganie, obiroisie emegati. Eyio nero or’abe gokoria ase engaki eyio y’amatuko amagana atato, na emerongo kianda, or’abe koraire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endagera yao or’abe gokoria nigo eraarengwe, nigo er’abe ey’ekerengo gie chisekeli emerongo ebere ase rituko erimo. Eyio nero or’abe gokoria rituko ase rituko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaache or’abe gokonywa naro goika arengwe, abe inse y’elita eyemo ase rituko erimo; naboigo orabe gokonywa rituko ase rituko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oroisie endagera yao buna emegati y’esairi, oyeroiserie ase abanto barooche igoro y’omorero bw’obonyira obwomo bwa Mwanyabaanto.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Omonene agateeba, “Naboigo Abaisraeli bararie endagera etachenegeti ekero barabe bare ase egati y’ abanto b’ebisaku biria ase ndabaserie gochia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio nkamoiraneria, nkamoteebia, “Yaya, Omonene, Naama, inche tinana gwesoyia ase ogotacheneka; korwa obwana bwane goika bono iga, tinana koria enyama y’eng’iti ekwete enyene, gose eyeitire ne ching’iti chinde; enyama ende yonsi y’okogechia tiyana gosoa ase omonwa one.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio Omonene aganteebia, “Bono ninkoe ribaga okoroiseria endagera yao igoro y’omorero bw’obwoyo obwomo bwe chiombe ribaga ri’omorero bw’obonyira bwa Mwanyabaanto.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Omonene aganteebia, “Aye Mwanyabaanto, ngochia inde gokeyia endagera ase Yerusalemu. Nigo baraarengerwe endagera bakoria, na bayerie bare n’obwoba. Boigo goika barengerwe amaache bakonywa, na bayanywe bare n’omoichano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninkore ayio, erinde baborwe endagera na amaache, na baichanerane omonto n’oyomwabo, na barabwo nigo bararee na kogireka ase engencho y’egesusuro ki’obobe bwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
